+# Incident & Remediation Playbook (Aegis)
+
+1) Detection
+ - Prometheus alert fires (reference alert rules in ops/monitoring/)
+ - SIEM receives anomalous cosign/rekor or HIL failure events
+
+2) Triage
+ - Assign incident lead and severity
+ - Collect evidence: PoA bundles, HIL logs, ADK traces, cosign/rekor verification
+
+3) Containment
+ - If safety-critical, trigger E-STOP (per ADK enforcer)
+ - Quarantine artifacts (block prompt promotions)
+
+4) Remediation
+ - Patch offending model/prompt
+ - Re-run tests: unit, sim, HIL, formal
+ - Produce signed evidence of remediation
+
+5) Postmortem
+ - Create postmortem, record in incident tracker, update prompts/registry policies
+
